{"seq":2,"slug":"patterns","title":"工程模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pagination-filtering","title":"分页、过滤与排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/patterns/pagination-filtering","wordCount":1150,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"idempotency-retry","title":"幂等性与重试设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/patterns/idempotency-retry","wordCount":1058,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"authentication-authorization","title":"认证与授权模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/patterns/authentication-authorization","wordCount":1090,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"# 工程模式\n\n选好范式、写好契约只是起点。真正让 API 在生产环境中可靠运行的，是一系列经过验证的工程模式：分页让大集合不压垮网络，幂等让重试不产生副作用，认证让每次调用都可追溯可授权。\n\n本章聚焦三个高频且易出错的模式：分页与过滤、幂等性设计、认证与授权。每一个都有明确的\"做对了什么样、做错了什么样\"的工程判据。\n"}